BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 295.07 Tm (leads, because messaging, pricing and case studies were still UK-only. Their fix is aligning sales and the deck before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 279.85 Tm (buying reach in a new market, and they warn that a Wynter survey at GBP 5,000 to GBP 6,000 is not cheap either) Tj ET
