BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (operations, zoning, and expansion [UqoyFfPDAmA @ 00:02:04]. AECOM's Adam Wei runs the screen at scale. He) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (scores megawatts per acre uniformly across 50-to-1,000-acre filters using sources like Open Infrastructure Map.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Because local data is weaker, a human reviews every result [DmHfrc4zfn0 @ 00:20:40].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (The roof crews run a repeatable field routine. Jansen/Adjusters International starts on soft metals \(caps, collars, vents,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (and AC fins\) to gauge hail size and quantity before touching the membrane. Golf ball or baseball hits "should pop out,") Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (while pea-size takes real hunting [oAK4wMoYcMA @ 00:01:09]. Their documentation system is the 10x10 test) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (square. Circle every hit inside the square. Highlight marks that are not hail, such as mechanical damage, to buy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (credibility. Separate heat blisters by their very clean circle. Mark the roof hours or a day before the adjuster arrives.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (About 20 hits in a single square got one roof bought [oAK4wMoYcMA @ 00:25:17]. Digital Roofing Innovations) Tj ET
