BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (set threshold. Carriers typically replace the whole roof when cuts show hits on every flat section [GciwM0T3IPE @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (00:02:20]. Tyler Melton of Proclaim Roofing turns that into a service model. On 20-year-old modified bitumen with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (damage every three feet, a prior roofer had called it no hail damage, yet the file ran to roughly a $1M loss. His crew) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (fixes and maintains leaks for free while the insurer takes months, then bills the carrier [m37LDnkUURI @ 00:01:35].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (The money math on the claim side is unforgiving. Policy & Property's breakdown of the State Farm memo shows the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (replace-to-repair ratio sliding from 3.2:1 to about 2:1. Their homeowner example: on a $300,000 home, a 2%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (deductible is $6,000. A $2,500 repair therefore pays nothing, a $15,000 replacement pays $9,000, and actual cash value) Tj ET
