BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 509.77 Tm (The fraud trap hits hardest in mass torts. Hoffmann's line is blunt: "the frauds will always answer." She reports that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 494.55 Tm (Reddit groups circulate clean marketing links to farm claims. Feedback therefore has to be real-time, not the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 479.32 Tm (two-to-three-month lag firms typically deliver [dxqvZPB25eo @ 00:10:01]. Her fix is a viability score on every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 464.10 Tm (ingested case. A case is scored nonviable \(with the reason, so firms can release it on ingestion\), potentially viable, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.87 Tm (confirmed, which counts as a bonus. The score lets marketers shut down any source that produces nonviables) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 433.65 Tm ([dxqvZPB25eo @ 00:03:43]. Zero Risk Cases attacks the same problem upstream with Scammer Scrub. It screens) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 418.42 Tm (every inbound and outbound lead against serial TCPA plaintiffs and lawsuit-mill litigators, updating in real time from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 403.20 Tm (court documents and the National Do Not Call list. Wet-signature documents are then notarized by a third-party notary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.97 Tm (who returns ID photos [bK2Wu8cOcRU @ 00:01:33]. The economics check is volume. Hoffmann says a marketer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 372.75 Tm (producing 1,000 NEC cases a week "doesn't make any sense." Depo cases rarely come in under $10,000 or faster than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 357.52 Tm (one to three a week. A firm demanding 30 Depo cases at $5,000 is told it is "not going to happen" [dxqvZPB25eo @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 342.30 Tm (00:06:32]. Juvenile abuse confirmation now drags 12 to 14 weeks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.07 Tm (The second trap is leakage between the ad and the signature. Loudr Media calls unconverted leads ad budget poured) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.85 Tm (into a "bucket with holes." Bad intake takes 5 to 15 minutes to call a lead back. Loudr's target is 60 seconds, with five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 296.62 Tm (minutes as the maximum. Hanging up on an untreated caller is a warning sign, because the script signs them anyway.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 281.40 Tm (The follow-up runs 30 days, using a rule of threes: three touches a day across call, text and email. One client signed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.17 Tm (only after two weeks [TJJfmZiIGW4 @ 00:01:21]. Ryan of Accelerated Marketing warns that "google only gets paid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.95 Tm (when you answer." LSA firms therefore need a backup call service, 24/7 coverage for personal injury, and a daily) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.72 Tm (disposition sheet that tags missed and abandoned calls [abdd1rgCZ90 @ 00:01:44]. The money check sits in disputes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 220.50 Tm (Anywhere from 10 to 50 of the calls get disputed, and that share of spend comes back in about a month and a half) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 205.27 Tm ([abdd1rgCZ90 @ 00:01:11]. SMB Team sees the same choke point on Meta. The path is ad, then form, then follow-up,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 190.05 Tm (and slow callbacks lose cases. Criminal and PI retargeting windows must stay short rather than running 90 to 120 days) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 174.82 Tm ([WZ82yYgND3M @ 00:11:52].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 159.60 Tm (The last traps are wasted spend and broken promises. Ali Katz watched lawyers burn tens of thousands of dollars on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 144.37 Tm (agencies that over-promise. Her conclusion from her own practice: "I didn't have a marketing problem." The real fault) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 129.15 Tm (was clarity and conversion [mDqUwOQyPnc @ 00:07:41]. Awais reports that his own YouTube channel has produced) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 113.92 Tm (one client since about March. He calls LinkedIn an "AI spam" bragging machine that is not worth it for law firms. He) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 98.70 Tm (also calls agencies that sell GEO/AEO as a separate service a scam [gFY3JFigbao @ 00:41:55]. On the retainer side,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 83.47 Tm (Leiman lists the killers: dividing the project fee by three, scope creep, becoming "furniture," and leaning on) Tj ET
