BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Anthony's Salesforce build is the most complete wiring diagram any of these operators shared. Multi-touch only starts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (once the record lives in Salesforce, and campaigns earn credit when the lead converts to an opportunity, because that is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (where revenue sits [JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:12:16]. Every marketing activity needs a completion action that drops) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (people into a campaign, including page actions on a waitlist page and custom redirects for case studies; conference) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (kiosk forms he calls an attribution black hole. To automate membership, he appends the Salesforce campaign ID to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (UTMs, captures it in a hidden 'SF campaign' form field, and fires a Flow that creates the campaign member) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ([JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:56:16]. Contact-role gaps get a scheduled Monday exception report grouped by rep, and a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (second Flow auto-adds same-domain contacts who were campaign members within a 30- or 60-day window under an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm ('automatic addition' role [JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:32:14]. His health check: if 51 percent or 70 to 80 percent of pipeline) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (is closed-won, opportunities are being opened too late; he targets roughly 30 percent and refuses auto-created) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (opportunities as technical debt. For reporting, he builds the customizable campaign influence report into a dashboard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (with one component per model [JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:41:46], and Chris Walker's channel split shows why the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (separation pays off [wkcuqfylydw @ 00:01:43].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (On HubSpot Pro, Sarah Lane-Hawn built a 'Goldilocks' model out of frustration with big attribution vendors that left) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (integration gaps and double counting [NZUqq5BtQuU @ 00:08:29]. The baseline tracks 12 channels, one custom build) Tj ET
