BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (pre-opportunity-creation view, and build versus buy, with the pitch that buying a model once beats a $30,000-a-year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (cycle. Their sample board narrative shows how the output gets used: paid search drove 23 percent of revenue on 50) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (percent of budget, explained by a three-month lag and revisited in six months [NZUqq5BtQuU @ 00:18:31].) Tj ET
