BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (deal-create and revenue attribution with linear, U-shaped and W-shaped models, but full multi-touch requires higher) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (tiers and quality depends on clean data [gKpbSCZMPqM @ 00:13:22]. Cole Furrh's stage map then turns the CRM into) Tj ET
