BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (calls pipeline [WOpqbZNyqNE @ 00:02:40].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (The stack numbers are concrete. VerifiedShortlist prices HubSpot at free for up to two users, Starter $20, Pro $100 plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm ($1,500 onboarding and Enterprise $150 plus $3,500, against Salesforce at Starter $25, Pro $100, Enterprise $175,) Tj ET
