BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 397.77 Tm (The most expensive failure is believing the dashboard. Passetto's case is a $250M ARR cybersecurity company that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 382.55 Tm (poured millions into paid-search free trials and got horrible win rates, low-value deals and negligible pipeline; the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 367.32 Tm (attribution mirage hides podcasts, Slack, conferences, LinkedIn and LLM mentions, hands all the credit to the final) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 352.10 Tm (organic search, and pushes companies to cut content in downturns [IYxZQrk554A @ 00:04:32]. GrowthSpree puts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.87 Tm (numbers on the blind spot: platform data misses 60 to 85 percent of revenue, and a 30-day click window against an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 321.65 Tm (84-day average B2B sales cycle captures only 5 to 15 percent of it [fdPFLXFJlwo @ 00:00:18]. Inside Salesforce,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.42 Tm (SalesLabX finds Pardot UTM fields are first-touch by default, so a cookie from a year earlier walks off with the credit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.20 Tm (while blank UTM fields are not automatically errors because ad spend has been seen lifting organic traffic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.97 Tm ([JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:09:31]. Value-First supplies the sanity check for the inverse distortion: if 90 percent of revenue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 260.75 Tm (shows as organic while real money is going into events, something is missing from the model [NZUqq5BtQuU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 245.52 Tm (00:30:29]. Every one of these traps looks like clean data until someone asks where the deals actually came from.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 230.30 Tm (Record hygiene is where pipelines quietly break. SalesLabX names three failure points: leads never converted,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.07 Tm (opportunities without contact roles, and undisciplined opportunity creation, where 51 percent or 70 to 80 percent of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.85 Tm (pipeline showing closed-won means opportunities are opened too late against a target of about 30 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 184.62 Tm ([JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:21:55]. The same firm finds that reps with no economic incentive simply will not add) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 169.40 Tm (campaign members, so campaign membership has to be automated, and kiosk forms at conferences turn into an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 154.17 Tm (attribution black hole [JkmlKUCHcmA @ 00:03:21]. Cole Furrh flags a HubSpot-specific trap: workflows that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.95 Tm (auto-move non-deal contacts, such as an IT signup, to the Customer stage fire false customer conversions, worst in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 123.72 Tm (branded and retargeting campaigns [WOpqbZNyqNE @ 00:03:29]. Biz Stack School's beginner build exposes the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 108.50 Tm (import-level traps: CSV stage names that do not match exactly are the number one reason deal imports fail, custom) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 93.27 Tm (fields should exist only if they feed a report, filter or decision, and a deal without a next step quietly dies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 78.05 Tm ([9qyxUfkZ05c @ 00:16:29]. The pattern across all four warnings is that bad attribution usually starts life as bad data) Tj ET
